    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15047\">PR #15047</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Requests and responses that carry both transfer-encoding and content-length are rejected before they reach the guest: 400 for a request and an HttpProtocolError for a response.</p>\n<p>Hyper passes both headers through, so a guest was getting a content-length that did not match the body it read.</p>\n</blockquote>",
